，吾不爲也。」及入，顗遂拜，而祥獨長揖。帝曰：「今日方知君見顧之重矣！」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"晉王","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"荀顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"相王","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"何侯","kind":"person","person_id":"h43_4st_7fx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p011:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段敘事、稱謂與引語身份辨識；不由同名自動合併。"},