"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001","text":"阮種，字德猷，陳留尉氏人，漢侍中胥卿八世孫也。弱冠有殊操，為嵇康所重。康著《養生論》，所稱阮生，即種也。察孝廉，為公府掾。是時西虜內侵，災眚屢見，百姓饑饉，詔三公、卿尹、常伯、牧守各舉賢良方正直言之士。於是太保何曾舉種賢良。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":2580,"raw_end":2696,"raw_character_offsets":[2580,2581,2582,2583,2584,2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609,2610,2611,2612,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2620,2621,2622,2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633,2634,2635,2636,2637,2638,2639,2640,2641,2642,2643,2644,2645,2646,2647,2648,2649,2650,2651,2652,2653,2654,2655,2656,2657,2658,2659,2660,2661,2662,2663,2664,2665,2666,2667,2668,2669,2670,2671,2672,2673,2674,2675,2676,2677,2678,2679,2680,2681,2682,2683,2684,2685,2686,2687,2688,2689,2690,2691,2692,2693,2694,2695],"revision_id":2604575},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"阮種","kind":"person","person_id":"tjj_q56_qkg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"德猷","kind":"person","person_id":"tjj_q56_qkg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"胥卿","kind":"person","person_id":"506_m4v_n94","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"嵇康","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"6fg_r6l_5a5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"阮生","kind":"person","person_id":"tjj_q56_qkg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"種","kind":"person","person_id":"tjj_q56_qkg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"何曾","kind":"person","person_id":"h43_4st_7fx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong:p001:m0108","start":108,"end":109,"surface":"種","kind":"person","person_id":"tjj_q56_qkg","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong","book_id":"b-jinshu-052","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong-ws2604575"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting","text":"晉公旣進爵為王，太尉王祥、司徒何曾、司空荀顗並詣王。顗曰：「相王尊重，何侯與一朝之臣皆已盡敬，今日便當相率而拜，無所疑也。」祥曰：「相國位勢，誠為尊貴，然要是魏之宰相，吾等魏之三公；公、王相去，一階而已，班列大同，安有天子三公可輙拜人者！損魏朝之望，虧晉王之德，君子愛人以禮，吾不為也。」及入，顗遂拜，而祥獨長揖。王謂祥曰：「今日然後知君見顧之重！」","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"晉公","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"何曾","kind":"person","person_id":"h43_4st_7fx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"荀顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"相王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"何侯","kind":"person","person_id":"h43_4st_7fx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"晉王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:meeting:m0159","start":159,"end":160,"surface":"祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","source_quote":{"witness":"sg4","quote":"晉公旣進爵為王，太尉王祥、司徒何曾、司空荀顗並詣王。顗曰：「相王尊重，何侯與一朝之臣皆已盡敬，今日便當相率而拜，無所疑也。」祥曰：「相國位勢，誠為尊貴，然要是魏之宰相，吾等魏之三公；公、王相去，一階而已，班列大同，安有天子三公可輙拜人者！損魏朝之望，虧晉王之德，君子愛人以禮，吾不為也。」及入，顗遂拜，而祥獨長揖。王謂祥曰：「今日然後知君見顧之重！」","raw_start":21404,"raw_end":21579,"raw_line":162,"source_layer":"裴注引漢晉春秋"},"attribution":{"annotator":"裴松之","quoted_work":"漢晉春秋","quoted_author":"習鑿齒"},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-004","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:promotion","text":"三月丁丑，以司空王祥為太尉，征北將軍何曾為司徒，尚書左僕射荀顗為司空。己卯，進晉公爵為王，封十郡，并前二十。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:promotion:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王祥","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:promotion:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"何曾","kind":"person","person_id":"h43_4st_7fx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:promotion:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"荀顗","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang:promotion:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"晉公","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"sg4","quote":"三月丁丑，以司空王祥為太尉，征北將軍何曾為司徒，尚書左僕射荀顗為司空。己卯，進晉公爵為王，封十郡，并前二十。","raw_start":21334,"raw_end":21388,"raw_line":162},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-004","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷三十三（數位選錄）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7033&oldid=2650519","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7033&oldid=2650519","revision_id":2650519,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"王祥完整本傳及王覽完整附傳；卷三十三後續鄭沖、何曾、石苞諸傳不在本單元。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未親核底本影像","response_sha256":"15791b8bdf731793ef02dbe27caed43b97631ae988fec2592c751dd3e7b5434a","wikitext_sha256":"2b422c350bf028f5d9b50e9791cc1b0caacd543dec80ad6fac445d99ae168721","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"去首部排版空白、展開連結顯示字、去單字-{字}-顯示語法、展開YL日期模板，不改漢未、乙太中大夫等見證原字；數位小標題不作正文證據。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p001","source_lines":[14,15],"raw_quote":"　　王祥，字休-{徵}-，琅邪臨沂人，漢諫議大夫吉之-{後}-也。祖仁，青州刺史。父融，公府-{辟}-不就。","raw_quote_sha256":"bbf3dd7ae2f5ab69161265874e14fa45662b17d748b0ed9dfb4277f51673ead8","selected_text_sha256":"2606dc497056559dfc79b2f4306effd4edc63587573a624f0c635c9a7f933c31","begin_anchor":"王祥，字休徵，琅邪臨沂人，漢諫","end_anchor":"，青州刺史。父融，公府辟不就。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p002","source_lines":[16,17],"raw_quote":"　　祥性至孝。早喪親，繼母朱氏不慈，數譖之，由是失愛-{於}-父。每使掃除牛下，祥愈恭謹。父母有疾，衣不解帶，湯藥必親嘗。母常欲生魚，時天寒冰凍，祥解衣將剖冰求之，冰忽自解，雙鯉躍出，持之而歸。母又思黃雀灸，復有黃雀數十飛入其幕，復以供母。鄕里驚歎，以爲孝感所致焉。有丹柰結實，母命守之，每風雨，祥輒抱樹而泣。其篤孝純至如此。","raw_quote_sha256":"dc9ce1d26c53c2956277a237beac6ec091d02d12f4606c6b73b296e1bc2ed704","selected_text_sha256":"2c688093a5217867f6e7925af5ae73722c0240557d6321d8a26953b0a416c14d","begin_anchor":"祥性至孝。早喪親，繼母朱氏不慈","end_anchor":"祥輒抱樹而泣。其篤孝純至如此。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p003","source_lines":[18,19],"raw_quote":"　　漢未遭亂，扶母攜弟覽避地廬江，隱居三十餘年，不應州郡之命。母終，居喪毀瘁，杖而-{後}-起。徐州刺史呂虔檄爲別駕，祥年垂耳順，固辭不受。覽勸之，爲具車牛，祥乃應召，虔委以州事。-{於}-時寇盜充斥，祥率勵兵士，頻討破之。州界清靜，政化大行。時人歌之曰：「海沂之康，實賴王祥。邦國不空，別駕之功。」","raw_quote_sha256":"be7909ef408ce89591e54a8b243d6e39e557934ae40e27ee69e51e7c14dd5fe7","selected_text_sha256":"49c4e1966467f962ddb1b0209c8b1574fc0e4528d48774c223f602768ad8c03f","begin_anchor":"漢未遭亂，扶母攜弟覽避地廬江，","end_anchor":"賴王祥。邦國不空，別駕之功。」"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p004","source_lines":[39,40],"raw_quote":"　　覽字玄通。母朱，遇祥無道。覽年數歲，見祥被楚撻，輒涕泣抱持。至-{於}-成童，每諫其母，其母少止凶虐。朱屢以非理使祥，覽輒與祥俱。又虐使祥妻，覽妻亦趨而共之。朱患之，乃止。祥喪父之-{後}-，漸有時譽。朱深疾之，密使鴆祥。覽知之，徑起取酒。祥疑其有毒，爭而不與，朱遽奪反之。自-{後}-朱賜祥饌，覽輒先嘗。朱懼覽致斃，遂止。","raw_quote_sha256":"64f4e0b8e61d56fdb63938babaa9bcfd88586084f2d432448f1ba052757a7b48","selected_text_sha256":"314bb9c6889d6f15a84853e4a5d0c19a45fb4b62c31e33688f473d06c21e4f8d","begin_anchor":"覽字玄通。母朱，遇祥無道。覽年","end_anchor":"，覽輒先嘗。朱懼覽致斃，遂止。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p005","source_lines":[41,42],"raw_quote":"　　覽孝友恭恪，名亞-{於}-祥。及祥仕進，覽亦應本郡之召，稍遷司徒西曹掾、清河太守。五等建，封即丘子，邑六百戸。泰始末，除弘訓少府。職省，轉太中大夫，祿賜與卿同。咸甯初，詔曰：「覽少篤至行，服仁履義，貞素之操，長而彌固。其以覽爲宗正卿。」頃之，以疾上疏乞骸骨。詔聽之，乙太中大夫歸老，賜錢二十萬，床帳薦褥，遣殿中醫療疾給藥。-{後}-轉光祿大夫，門施行馬。","raw_quote_sha256":"40419a8eb7ece09dddabc61f0bd52c592e894e00ff14dcf36cdcc4135176b321","selected_text_sha256":"0236e27239e1247db380e51e73fef7d1df04e1132d77d32644b7c8e24878789a","begin_anchor":"覽孝友恭恪，名亞於祥。及祥仕進","end_anchor":"給藥。後轉光祿大夫，門施行馬。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p006","source_lines":[43,44],"raw_quote":"　　{{YL|咸寧四年}}卒，時年七十三，諡曰貞。有六子：裁、基、會、正、彥、琛。","raw_quote_sha256":"1b676a2f07bf1dcf5ca27b5af4d9912c1d31377fc3a8e6ce355ff58306231c0b","selected_text_sha256":"e490f9134a325ad7545ba632b20b15665e49864e2da4018e00c8bae8b0ea31b7","begin_anchor":"咸寧四年卒，時年七十三，諡曰貞","end_anchor":"六子：裁、基、會、正、彥、琛。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p007","source_lines":[45,46],"raw_quote":"　　裁字士初，撫軍長史。[[晉書/卷098#王敦|基]]字士先，治書御史。[[晉書/卷076#王舒|會]]字士和，侍御史。正字士則，尚書郎。彥字士治，中護軍。琛字士瑋，國子祭酒。","raw_quote_sha256":"46758aedb5388938223c2d591ce503993c0f591832c8a420457d713e3e252407","selected_text_sha256":"242d4aeb39a37bc009c4fdb993964b5808dc99a4da29a349c17e8d9c5ba3342c","begin_anchor":"裁字士初，撫軍長史。基字士先，","end_anchor":"，中護軍。琛字士瑋，國子祭酒。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p008","source_lines":[47,48],"raw_quote":"　　初，呂虔有佩刀，工相之，以爲必登三公，可服此刀。虔謂祥曰：「苟非其人，刀或爲害。卿有公輔之量，故以相與。」祥固辭，強之乃受。祥臨薨，以刀授覽，曰：「汝-{後}-必興，足稱此刀。」覽-{後}-奕世多賢才，興-{於}-江左矣。裁子導，[[晉書/卷065|別有傳]]。","raw_quote_sha256":"a43f33c97b30853834d357d68a90d5e08fd1668a05e8469de66623b9d3c5efbe","selected_text_sha256":"19ba4970c1e7d6440a46690f3e567bf0af4efe92c07358ffca2a20c540acb2d0","begin_anchor":"初，呂虔有佩刀，工相之，以爲必","end_anchor":"，興於江左矣。裁子導，別有傳。"}],"completion_appendix":"同固定修訂2650519補入原始行20–35八段；原八段全文、ID與mentions全值保留。原字漢未、乙太保、Я脯等不靜改。"},"collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin033-wang-family-children/reading.json","source-evidence/jin033-wanglan/reading.json","source-evidence/jin033-wangxiang/reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-052","source_id":"s-jinshu-052-ruan-zhong-ws2604575","source":{"title":"晉書卷五十二·阮種","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2604575","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2604575","revision_id":2604575,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-22","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"晉書卷五十二·阮種","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"source-evidence/sanguozhi064-roll/external/jin052-ws2604575.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"bc23c6fb49d83914c3f16c54b867415d8da7e44bee413a61cefb0c18cac5a212","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin052-roll/volume-reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-004","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-004-jin033-wangxiang","source":{"title":"三國志三少帝紀","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8746774","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8746774","revision_id":8746774,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"下列來源節錄。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"固定修訂相關原文，逐字核收。","wikitext_sha256":"b7d193dc3fadd4d04f4fb892ba2e6b308bff1bf2053585f7af296ffc9c4f5bab","raw_path":"source-evidence/jin033-wangxiang/external/sg4-ws8746774.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"b7d193dc3fadd4d04f4fb892ba2e6b308bff1bf2053585f7af296ffc9c4f5bab"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial